        "TileImage": "$($repository d3eedfca-20b3-4de6-b714-733c59be1fe1).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, Agent 47. \rGood afternoon, Agent 47. Today you received a unique contract from the Teen Titans. They have detected the dormant agents of the Brotherhood of Evil and the guy Kitten, who is connected to criminal organizations in Southeast Asia. You must kill them, but the Teen Titans themselves don’t want to kill them personally, as it would destroy their reputation as superheroes, so this mission has been entrusted to you, 47. \rFarewell.",
